---
args: {"scene": "SceneInformation", "evidence": "EvidenceItem[]"}
returns: "RevealBoundary[]"
---
Separate what can be directly seen or heard now from motives, relationships and later explanations. Bind a visible clue's plain description to the actual scene, and its significance only to the later evidenced reveal. An off-screen voice may be named only when the source establishes that identity at this point. Do not add a future character name simply because the script later identifies them.
